<title>INDONESIA: Sinar Mas 1996 net up to 197.98 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Sinar Mas 1996 net up to 197.98 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			197.98 vs 142.24</p>
<p>    Revenues			  2,566.69 vs 1,931.25</p>
<p>    Expenses			  2,113.17 vs 1,603.51</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  453.52   vs   327.74</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)     298  vs   227</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		331.96  vs  162.54</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Sinar Mas Multiartha, a member of the Sinar Mas Group, is engaged in consumer financing and factoring.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
